Z||000022||Tigger||11-06-2001||01:04 PM||||There's a chrome-illusion painted mid eighties Buick Regal around here with 20" gold Dayton wires.  Oh yeah, it's a Pimpin car...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif">   The guy had to jack up the suspension just to get them to fit... man it looks donkey.<P>20"s with decent tire rubber look great on full size trucks/suvs.  Any bigger than 18"s on cars & 20"s on trucks and they start going out of perspective.  Probably exponentially increases your chances of getting shot.<P>BTW, The Celica to the right in the pic looks sweet.  I've wanted to see one lowered and with cool wheels.  I bet old people tell him to slow down all the time and dogs run into the back of it.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 11-06-2001).]||||reg||10
